]make highlighting, completion candidates, and common-placeholder [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recording raw-only.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Unified prompt input plan and placeholder substitution[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]plan[dim] · [dim][/dim]after facade[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase plan' section: build the pure-logic PromptInputPlan that merges [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]raw placeholders with declared frontmatter inputs and applies collected [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]values to a prompt.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prompt Inputs panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after plan[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase panel' section: grow InputCollectionModal into the single-page [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Prompt Inputs panel with a placeholder section, context snippets, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keep-literal, and PNG snapshots.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Wire collection into the prompt-bar launch path[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]submit[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase submit' section: gate the panel on submit from the ACE prompt [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bar, substitute values before launch, record tags, and add the config [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]toggles.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Placeholders become xprompt input arguments[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]xpromptargs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after facade[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase xpromptargs' section: convert raw placeholders into text input [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]arguments and Jinja r